  "description": "MAUI.GoogleChartsView is a user-friendly charting control designed for .NET MAUI applications.\nBy harnessing the capabilities of Google Charts, it offers customizable data visualizations to suit a wide range of data types.\nSupports chart events, PNG export, and platform-specific gallery saving.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
