  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n- Fixed ZoomEnabled property (now functional)\n- Added PNG export functionality with platform-specific gallery saving\n- Added chart events: ChartReady, ChartSelected, ChartClicked, ChartError, ChartImageReady\n- Implemented IDisposable for proper resource cleanup\n- Fixed animation options handling (no longer fragile string manipulation)\n- Updated to .NET 9\n- Added proper error propagation via ChartError event",
